; An allocation the runtime cannot have is a runtime error: the report
; locates the form that asked for it (exit 5). The golden runs with
; NEXIS_MAX_ALLOC=16777216, so the list below, 16 bytes an element,
; fails as it passes 16 MiB instead of exhausting the machine.

(defn fill [n]
  (count (repeat n 0)))

(println "before")
(fill 100000000)
(println "never")
